title: Nutanix Prism: VM Categories (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the categories (key: value) assigned to a Nutanix VM.

 With the rule "Nutanix VM Categories" a list of expected categories can be
 configured. If an expected category is missing the service goes to WARN,
 categories which are assigned but not expected are OK by default. Both
 states can be configured. An expected category without value accepts any
 value of that category.

 Every assigned category is also set as host label "nutanix/category/<name>"
 with the category value as label value (several values are sorted and joined
 by ","), e.g. "nutanix/category/Veeam:Bronze".

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created for every VM, also if no categories are assigned.
